.TH urlmenu-forget 1  "forget " 
.SH NAME
urlmenu\-forget \- Reset the picks remembered for a site, or for every site
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBurlmenu forget\fR [\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fISITE\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reset the picks remembered for a site, or for every site
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Print what would run as JSON instead of running it
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fISITE\fR]
URL or host, e.g. `github.com`
